repository-code: "https://github.com/gitchang893/imic-context-exchange"
url: "https://github.com/gitchang893/imic-context-exchange"

license: MIT

abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifacts for the study "Purpose-Bounded Context Exchange
  in Enterprise Agentic AI Systems: An Inter-Module Information Contract
  Architecture." The repository contains the frozen synthetic benchmark,
  canonical reference oracle, original experimental source code, deterministic
  benchmark results, downstream local-language-model run artifacts, response
  logs, final merged results, and analysis and audit utilities for evaluating
  the Inter-Module Information Contract (IMIC) architecture.

keywords:
  - "agentic AI"
  - "enterprise AI"
  - "context exchange"
  - "information governance"
  - "purpose limitation"
  - "multi-hop information exchange"
  - "Inter-Module Information Contract"
  - "IMIC"
  - "reproducibility"
